==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Inosuke Hashibira CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Inosuke Hashibira is an [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]]/[[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|Aku]] crowd-controller similar to [[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Devil Hunter Satoru]], exchanging range for sheer endurance through the [[Resistant]] ability. Generally, he is powerful as a midrange tank and [[Shield Piercing|Shield Piercer]] who is can take a beating from target traits with his 326,400 effective HP against [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and 408,000 effective HP against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] at Lv.30. To draw a comparison, this almost matches [[Maeda Keiji (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Keiji]]'s 493,000 VS. Dark at equal levels, exchanging that bit of EHP for better support.

He makes quick work of most Aku [[Shield]]s, and serves as a great supplemental DPS/support in any Aku/Black stage with his decent all-around stats, [[Omni Strike]] and [[Knockback]]. He attacks fast, is able to juggle Dark enemies with relative ease, and outranges most common Aku to where he can comfortably support the team by keeping the frontline and midrange in check, despite his lack of Surge Immunity.

What really separates Inosuke Hashibira is his [[Behemoth Slayer]] ability, and the matchups that facilitates. To start, he counters [[Ragin' Gory]] and [[Casaurian Darkjo]] very well thanks to his [[Immune to Toxic|Immunity to Toxic]], as well as the ridiculous stat boosts Behemoth Slayer provides against said enemies. The same applies to [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] due to his Freeze Immunity and its weak Shield. The somewhat low Shield Piercing odds can make handling [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] problematic when accompanied by other enemies to support him, but it is usually little worry so long as you can protect Inosuke Hashibira well enough until it procs. Finally, [[Crocodylidae Kurocroc]] is usually seen with much more dangerous enemies that make Inosuke Hashibira's use dubious at best. However, with a generally favorable set of matchups, he still finds a place as a competent Behemoth Slayer cat.

