==Trivia==
*Due to his [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] target, Inosuke Hashibira is the only [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event|Demon Slayer]] unit to actually be more effective against demonic enemies.
**The reason most of them aren't [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|anti-Aku]] may be because they are specialized in fighting a different type of demon than the Aku. In Japanese, the demons from ''Demon Slayer'' are called 鬼 ''[[wikipedia:Oni|oni]]'' (a type of demon-like ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]''), whereas the Aku trait is 悪魔 ''Akuma'' ("Devil").
*Inosuke Hashibira's Toxic Immunity could be a reference to the anime where he says, while fighting Daki, "Shifting the positions of my internal organs is child's play for me! And since I grew up on the harsh mountainside, poison doesn't work on me either!".

